      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خُصُومَةٌ</span></b>  <i>Contention</i> or <i>altercation; disputation;
litigation;</i> (K, TA;) a subst. from 3 (S, TA)
or 8 (JK, * TA) and 6, as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خُصْمَةٌ</span></b>  and
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خُصْمَانِيَّةٌ</span></b> . (TA.) <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَصْلُ الخُصُومَةِ</span>: see art.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فصل</span>. [See also an ex. voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُكْمٌ</span>.]

